      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00789",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“曾经有两次都快要分手哩。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There were two times when we nearly broke up.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00789",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "一次是在这里当艺妓，一次是从师傅家搬到现在这个家的时候。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "One was when I became a geisha here, and the other was when I moved from my teacher's house to this house where I live now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00789",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "可是我的意志太薄弱了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But my will was too weak.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00789",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我的意志实在太薄弱了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My will really is far too weak.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
